  era: "Later Vedic onwards \xB7 Section 3 \xB7 Vedic Period \xB7 c. 1500 \u2013 600 BCE"
  title: Ashrama system
  text: 'Later texts describe four stages of life for men of the upper varnas: brahmacharya, the student; grihastha, the householder; vanaprastha, retreat to the forest; and sannyasa, renunciation. It was an ideal rather than a universal practice.'
